    title
    variants(first: 1) {
      edges {
        node {
          price {
            amount
            currencyCode
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

*Note: In the Storefront API, you usually pass the `currencyCode` as a variable in the query or via the `X-Shopify-Storefront-Client-Tag` header depending on the specific version of the API you are using, though the most common method is passing it in the query variables.*

